  "changes": [
    "Parse/hash the same captured pin/helper/Bun-version bytes and refuse movement before probes.",
    "The shared bounded-reader owner opens a descriptor with no-follow/nonblocking flags, verifies its actual kernel path is inside the checkout and regular-file status, then reads at most oneMiB.",
